{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061224/block/singleImage/3253700/df/01M6600F060MWSG8SCZXMXE934.jpg?updatedAt=1793350278\"/><figcaption>青衣發生交通意外。（fb「青衣街坊吹水會」圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>青衣發生交通意外。 今日（30日）中午12時51分，一輛電單車沿青衣青康路行駛，駛至青康邨對開位置時遭一輛轉入邨內的私家車攔腰撞倒，電單車人仰車翻，鐵騎士飛彈地上受傷，司機大驚報警。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，由救護車將鐵騎士送院治理。警方正在調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:44:51.842120+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:51:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.983057+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:39:04.236894+00:00","content_hash":"52587173f20e17e1613d02c4339627284cb10699dd01213629f2e16366fd7367","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:44:51.842120+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}